{"id": "60726", "title": "求求你，我好痛", "author": "不详", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 8, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/60/60726.htm", "intro": "人物介绍\r\n\r\n鲜网貌似不可上载艺人的照片\r\n还是用写的吧。\r\n\r\n司徒风---以速水直道为蓝本\r\n司徒翼---以赤西仁为蓝本\r\n司徒日，司徒月---以山下智久为蓝本　(双胞胎，相同样子)\r\n\r\n大家有没有什麽喜好?\r\n本人较喜欢这三位日本艺人啊。", "base": "files/article/html/60/60726", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "8918696.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "8918697.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "8918698.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "8918700.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "8918702.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "8918705.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "8918706.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36", "file": "8918707.html", "available": false}]}